# Build on Vercel's Linux runtime, never ship this Mac's build output or deps.
# sharp ships platform-specific native binaries (@img/sharp-<os>-<arch>); uploading
# a macOS node_modules made the linux-x64 function fail to dlopen libvips, which
# 500'd every image render. Excluding both forces a clean install + build remotely.
